        "pkcontributionId": 54212,
        "bookId": 31,
        "chapterId": 20,
        "headingId": 159,
        "headingText": "<p>Fundic gland polyps (FGPs) are benign gastric epithelial lesions consisting of hyperplastic expansion of the deep epithelial compartment of the oxyntic mucosa.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2019-01-29T15:17:44"
      }
    ],
